stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Generated
    Generated --> RenderEligible: scopes recorded at generation
    RenderEligible --> Rendered: current scopes permit
    RenderEligible --> Invalidated: revocation, expiry, or scope mismatch
    Rendered --> Invalidated: render-time re-evaluation denies
    Invalidated --> RedactedExplanation: protected content removed
    RedactedExplanation --> Regenerated: user requests a new suggestion
    Regenerated --> RenderEligible
